<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIA ZONE SECOND ROUND DRAW.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD CUP ASIA ZONE SECOND ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the second round of the</p>
<p>Asia zone of the World Cup qualifying competition on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Saudi Arabia</p>
<p>Kuwait</p>
<p>China</p>
<p>Iran</p>
<p>Qatar</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>South Korea</p>
<p>Kazakhstan</p>
<p>Japan</p>
<p>Uzbekistan</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates</p>
<p>Each group will play a league system in which each team</p>
<p>plays the others in a home and away format.</p>
<p>Matches to be played between September 12 and November 9.</p>
<p>Venues to be determined by the relevant federations.</p>
<p>Winners of each group go through to the finals in France.</p>
<p>Runners-up play each other on neutral ground by November 15 with</p>
<p>the winner qualifying for the finals.</p>
<p>Loser plays Australia, Oceania group winners, in a two-leg</p>
<p>play-off on November 22 and 29 for the remaining place in</p>
<p>France.</p>
</text>
